- o Clinical Disease Activity Index (CDAI);
- o Disease Activity Score in 28 Joints with Erythrocyte Sedimentation Rate or C-Reactive Protein Level (DAS28-ESR/CRP);
- o Simplified Disease Activity Index (SDAI);
- o Routine Assessment of Patient Index Data 3 (RAPID3);
- o Patient Activity Scale-II (PAS-II); AND
